  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montreal Programme Office on Urban Climate Change and Biodiversity Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Montreal Office fosters linkages among research, policy, and action to advance sustainable urban development globally. The office will activate a network of key partners to accelerate the quality and scale of urban sustainability solutions to implement the UN-Habitat Strategic Plan, in particular climate and biodiversity solutions to enhance urban resilience and protect vulnerable groups. It will promote the development and synthesis of science, data, innovation, and solutions on urban sustainability to improve the urban environment. In addition, the Montreal Office will establish close working relations with Canadian and North American local governments.</narrative>
  </description>
